"Continuing Student Dining Plan\nChoose one of our flexible dining plans that best suits your lifestyle and needs. Your Dining Dollars can be used to dine or shop at our nearly 20 residential dining and market locations throughout campus, regardless of your residential community. Plus, dining plans come with a minimum of $500 in Triton Cash, accepted at more than 60 locations on and off campus.\nYour Dining Dollars rollover into the following fall quarter of the next academic year, providing you with more time to benefit from your unused funds. For example, your Dining Dollars from academic year 2023-24 will expire at the end of Fall Quarter 2024. Check your balance online at the Transact eAccounts Portal.\n2026-27 Continuing Student Dining Plan Options\nHere are some examples to help you determine which plan to choose*:\nTriton Gold: $8,200 ($6,700 Dining Dollars + $1,500 Triton Cash)\nWe recommend this plan if…\nYou enjoy three full meals a day during the school week, plus snacks in between classes\nYou plan to eat some meals off campus during the weekends\nDaily Dining Dollar spend estimate: $27/day\nTriton Blue: $6,600 ($5,600 Dining Dollars + $1,000 Triton Cash)\nWe recommend this plan if…\nYou enjoy a light breakfast and lunch, and a hearty dinner\nYou plan to spend your weekends off campus\nDaily Dining Dollar spend estimate: $23/day\nTriton: $5,350 ($4,850 Dining Dollars + $500 Triton Cash)\nWe recommend this plan if…\nYour dining routine is more spontaneous (i.e., a light lunch and hearty dinner one day, only breakfast and a light dinner the next)\nYou plan to pick up groceries from our markets to prepare group meals with your suitemates\nDaily Dining Dollar spend estimate: $20/day\nThis plan does not guarantee or provide more than 10 meals per week.\nSun God Gold: $4,400 ($3,400 Dining Dollars + $1,000 Triton Cash)\nWe recommend this plan if…\nA full meal a day during the school week (supplemented with snacks in between classes) keeps you fueled\nYou venture off campus sporadically throughout the week and grab a few meals\nDaily Dining Dollar spend estimate: $14/day\nSun God Blue: $2,950 ($2,450 Dining Dollars + $500 Triton Cash)\nWe recommend this plan if…\nYou are always on-the-go, fueling yourself with beverages and snacks throughout the day and a hearty meal on campus with friends when you have the time\nYou eat a good amount of your meals off campus throughout the week\nDaily Dining Dollar spend estimate: $10/day\nTriton Community Plan: $1500 ($500 Dining Dollars + $1000 Triton Cash)\nOnly available to students eligible for Pepper Canyon East, Pepper Canyon West or Rita Atkinson Apartments.\n2025-26 Continuing Student Dining Plan Options\nTriton Gold: $7,800 ($6,300 Dining Dollars + $1,500 Triton Cash)\nTriton Blue: $6,300 ($5,300 Dining Dollars + $1,000 Triton Cash)\nTriton: $5,100 ($4,600 Dining Dollars + $500 Triton Cash)\nSun God Gold: $4,200 ($3,200 Dining Dollars + $1,000 Triton Cash)\nSun God Blue: $2,800 ($2,300 Dining Dollars + $500 Triton Cash)\nTriton Community Plan: $1500 ($500 Dining Dollars + $1000 Triton Cash)\n*Please note that the figures provided are Dining Dollar estimates. They do not include Triton Cash as purchases vary for each student.\nContinuing Student Dining Plan\nIncoming Student Dining Plan\nDining Dollars FAQ\nBudgeting Dining Dollars and Triton Cash"